{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_adr_0104_desktop_cross_collaborator_communication_is_direct_delegates_or_typed_callback_interfaces_never_a_desktop_local_mediator_command_dispatcher_or_event_dispatcher_adr_0104", "label": "ADR-0104", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0104-desktop-cross-collaborator-communication-is-direct-delegates-or-typed-callback-interfaces-never-a-desktop-local-mediator-command-dispatcher-or-event-dispatcher.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Desktop cross-collaborator communication is direct delegates by default, a typed callback interface only at three or more related callbacks; a Desktop-local Mediator, Command Dispatcher or Event Dispatcher is rejected by name because the composition root is fixed, small and compile-time-known \u2014 no genuine extensibility trigger."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0104_desktop_cross_collaborator_communication_is_direct_delegates_or_typed_callback_interfaces_never_a_desktop_local_mediator_command_dispatcher_or_event_dispatcher_direct_delegates", "label": "Direct Delegates", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0104-desktop-cross-collaborator-communication-is-direct-delegates-or-typed-callback-interfaces-never-a-desktop-local-mediator-command-dispatcher-or-event-dispatcher.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Zero new abstraction; compiler-checked; a stack trace shows the real call chain; every dependency visible in the constructor signature; trivially testable with a lambda."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0104_desktop_cross_collaborator_communication_is_direct_delegates_or_typed_callback_interfaces_never_a_desktop_local_mediator_command_dispatcher_or_event_dispatcher_typed_callback_interface", "label": "Typed Callback Interface", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0104-desktop-cross-collaborator-communication-is-direct-delegates-or-typed-callback-interfaces-never-a-desktop-local-mediator-command-dispatcher-or-event-dispatcher.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reduces constructor sprawl and names a call site, at the cost of one more type and one more hop; only worth it above the three-callback threshold."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0104_desktop_cross_collaborator_communication_is_direct_delegates_or_typed_callback_interfaces_never_a_desktop_local_mediator_command_dispatcher_or_event_dispatcher_three_callback_threshold", "label": "Three-Callback Threshold", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0104-desktop-cross-collaborator-communication-is-direct-delegates-or-typed-callback-interfaces-never-a-desktop-local-mediator-command-dispatcher-or-event-dispatcher.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Counts delegate-shaped callback parameters, not total constructor parameters; a starting heuristic, not a provable line \u2014 revise the ADR rather than deviate."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0104_desktop_cross_collaborator_communication_is_direct_delegates_or_typed_callback_interfaces_never_a_desktop_local_mediator_command_dispatcher_or_event_dispatcher_desktop_local_mediator", "label": "Desktop-Local Mediator", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0104-desktop-cross-collaborator-communication-is-direct-delegates-or-typed-callback-interfaces-never-a-desktop-local-mediator-command-dispatcher-or-event-dispatcher.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rejected: needs a runtime registry (moving MainWindow's wiring sideways) or reflection auto-discovery (already rejected by ADR-0103); regresses testability since a sender needs a populated Mediator, not a lambda."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0104_desktop_cross_collaborator_communication_is_direct_delegates_or_typed_callback_interfaces_never_a_desktop_local_mediator_command_dispatcher_or_event_dispatcher_desktop_local_command_dispatcher", "label": "Desktop-Local Command Dispatcher", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0104-desktop-cross-collaborator-communication-is-direct-delegates-or-typed-callback-interfaces-never-a-desktop-local-mediator-command-dispatcher-or-event-dispatcher.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rejected: a second dispatcher reintroduces the two-registration-mechanism confusion ADR-0070 and ADR-0099 exist to prevent; KeyboardShortcutActions already serves pure UI actions with zero framework."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0104_desktop_cross_collaborator_communication_is_direct_delegates_or_typed_callback_interfaces_never_a_desktop_local_mediator_command_dispatcher_or_event_dispatcher_desktop_local_event_dispatcher", "label": "Desktop-Local Event Dispatcher", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0104-desktop-cross-collaborator-communication-is-direct-delegates-or-typed-callback-interfaces-never-a-desktop-local-mediator-command-dispatcher-or-event-dispatcher.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rejected: IEventBus already exists platform-wide; a Desktop-only bus would misuse that channel or stand up a parallel pub/sub for a fixed known set, and pub/sub hides the consumer list at the publish site."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0104_desktop_cross_collaborator_communication_is_direct_delegates_or_typed_callback_interfaces_never_a_desktop_local_mediator_command_dispatcher_or_event_dispatcher_workspaceviewcoordinator", "label": "WorkspaceViewCoordinator", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0104-desktop-cross-collaborator-communication-is-direct-delegates-or-typed-callback-interfaces-never-a-desktop-local-mediator-command-dispatcher-or-event-dispatcher.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "18-parameter constructor cited as motivating evidence; only 2 genuine callbacks at acceptance, 3 after WP 12.4B (refreshCockpit) \u2014 interface deliberately deferred."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0104_desktop_cross_collaborator_communication_is_direct_delegates_or_typed_callback_interfaces_never_a_desktop_local_mediator_command_dispatcher_or_event_dispatcher_icommandregistry_icommanddispatcher", "label": "ICommandRegistry / ICommandDispatcher", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0104-desktop-cross-collaborator-communication-is-direct-delegates-or-typed-callback-interfaces-never-a-desktop-local-mediator-command-dispatcher-or-event-dispatcher.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0104_desktop_cross_collaborator_communication_is_direct_delegates_or_typed_callback_interfaces_never_a_desktop_local_mediator_command_dispatcher_or_event_dispatcher_ieventbus", "label": "Tempest.Core.Events.IEventBus", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0104-desktop-cross-collaborator-communication-is-direct-delegates-or-typed-callback-interfaces-never-a-desktop-local-mediator-command-dispatcher-or-event-dispatcher.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0104_desktop_cross_collaborator_communication_is_direct_delegates_or_typed_callback_interfaces_never_a_desktop_local_mediator_command_dispatcher_or_event_dispatcher_platformnotificationtoastbridge", "label": "PlatformNotificationToastBridge", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0104-desktop-cross-collaborator-communication-is-direct-delegates-or-typed-callback-interfaces-never-a-desktop-local-mediator-command-dispatcher-or-event-dispatcher.md", "source_lo